{"step": 3, "raw_content": "Now I understand the task. I need to modify `mark_retry_requested` to:\n1. Convert a `TimeoutError` into `False`\n2. Roll back when the session supports rollback\n3. Return `True` after a successful update\n4. Keep the method name unchanged\n\nThe test uses a `TimeoutSession` that raises `TimeoutError` and has a `rollback` method. The `DatabaseSession` doesn't have a `rollback` method, so I need to check for it via `hasattr`.\n\nLet me implement this:", "native_tool_calls": [{"call_id": "step-3-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_q9RD6Rf28svwG4ke2VR12864", "name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/invoices.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice persistence.\"\"\"\n\nfrom src.common.database import create_session\nfrom src.common.time import utc_now\n\n\nclass InvoiceRepository:\n    \"\"\"Stores invoice state.\"\"\"\n\n    def mark_retry_requested(self, invoice_id: str) -> bool:\n        session = create_session()\n        try:\n            session.execute(\n                \"update invoices set retry_requested_at=:now where invoice_id=:invoice_id\",\n                {\"invoice_id\": invoice_id, \"now\": utc_now().isoformat()},\n            )\n        except TimeoutError:\n            if hasattr(session, \"rollback\"):\n                session.rollback()\n            return False\n        return True\n"}]}}], "dialect": null, "canonical_payload": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/invoices.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice persistence.\"\"\"\n\nfrom src.common.database import create_session\nfrom src.common.time import utc_now\n\n\nclass InvoiceRepository:\n    \"\"\"Stores invoice state.\"\"\"\n\n    def mark_retry_requested(self, invoice_id: str) -> bool:\n        session = create_session()\n        try:\n            session.execute(\n                \"update invoices set retry_requested_at=:now where invoice_id=:invoice_id\",\n                {\"invoice_id\": invoice_id, \"now\": utc_now().isoformat()},\n            )\n        except TimeoutError:\n            if hasattr(session, \"rollback\"):\n                session.rollback()\n            return False\n        return True\n"}]}, "runtime_call_id": "step-3-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_q9RD6Rf28svwG4ke2VR12864"}]}, "parse_error": null, "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "provider": "openai-compatible", "response_id": "8ff4a459-c441-4d8b-9bfc-f408b3dc0e7c", "finish_state": "tool_calls", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "actual_response_mode": "native_tools", "incomplete_reason": null, "system_fingerprint": "a307abda487cd1b463329ccb945ce396", "input_tokens": 6278, "output_tokens": 351}
